//Add validation here so that a lot is not moved from *Dark Room* or *Fridge* to Fruiting or from *Dark Room* to *Fridge* because the user should use Move(Transition) instead.  Also the lot should not be moved to Compost, Expired, or Retired here because they should use the Retire button instead. A lot should not be moved to Consumed in any case because this is handled by Spawn to Bulk. 
true
}}

location_id.selectOptions:
{{(() => { const tableData = tblLots.processedTableData || []; return tableData.length > 0 ? tableData.map((currentRow, currentIndex) => ( 
  (qLocations.data || []).map(loc => ({ 
    label: loc.name, 
    value: loc.nocopk 
  })) 
)) :  
  (qLocations.data || []).map(loc => ({ 
    label: loc.name, 
    value: loc.nocopk 
  })) 
 })()}}

